# Files stripped from ``git archive`` tarballs (what SwiftPM consumers
# resolve when they depend on a tag from a hosted git provider that
# serves source archives — e.g. GitHub release assets). Each entry is
# kept in the working tree for development context but not shipped to
# package consumers.
#
# CLAUDE.md  — internal contributor notes (running tests, Mac-app
#              workflow). Not consumer-relevant.
# docs/      — internal e2e-test docs referencing repo paths and
#              fixture credentials. Not consumer-relevant.
# scripts/   — local dev helpers (e.g. ``e2e.sh``) that point at the
#              dev backend. Not consumer-relevant.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
docs export-ignore
docs/ export-ignore
scripts export-ignore
scripts/ export-ignore
